      <a href="/" itemprop="item"><span itemprop="name">Home</span></a>
      <meta itemprop="position" content="1" />
    </li>
    <li class="breadcrumb__item breadcrumb__item--current" itemprop="itemListElement" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/ListItem">
      <span itemprop="name">Clothing Brand Startup Costs</span>
      <meta itemprop="position" content="2" />
    </li>
  </ol>
</nav>

<main id="main-content">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero__container">
      <div class="hero__content">
        <p class="hero__label">Real Numbers | Three Business Models | Sourced Data</p>
        <h1 class="hero__title">How Much Does It Cost to Start a Clothing Brand?</h1>
        <p class="hero__description">
          The honest answer depends on which model you're running, not a single number. A print-on-demand launch, a custom cut-and-sew brand, and a wholesale-ready label have genuinely different budgets — this breaks down all three with sourced figures, not guesses. If you want the manufacturing side specifically, see our <a href="/clothing-manufacturing-cost-guide" style="color:#e00;text-decoration:none;">clothing manufacturing cost guide</a>, or the full process in our <a href="/how-to-start-a-clothing-brand" style="color:#e00;text-decoration:none;">how to start a clothing brand</a> guide.
        </p>
        <div class="hero__stats">
          <div class="hero__stat">
            <span class="hero__stat-value">$2K-50K+</span>
            <span class="hero__stat-label">Realistic Range</span>
          </div>
          <div class="hero__stat">
            <span class="hero__stat-value">3</span>
            <span class="hero__stat-label">Business Models</span>
          </div>
          <div class="hero__stat">
            <span class="hero__stat-value">Sourced</span>
            <span class="hero__stat-label">Every Figure</span>
          </div>
          <div class="hero__stat">
            <span class="hero__stat-value">6</span>
            <span class="hero__stat-label">FAQ Questions</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero__ctas">
          <a href={whatsappQuoteUrl} class="hero__cta hero__cta--primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
