              <td data-label="Cut-and-Sew D2C">$1,500-6,000</td>
              <td data-label="Wholesale-Ready">$5,000-15,000</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="comparison__row--highlight">
              <td data-label="Cost Category"><strong>Website/E-commerce</strong></td>
              <td data-label="Print-on-Demand">$500-1,000</td>
              <td data-label="Cut-and-Sew D2C">$1,000-2,500</td>
              <td data-label="Wholesale-Ready">$2,000-8,000</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td data-label="Cost Category"><strong>Branding/Design</strong></td>
              <td data-label="Print-on-Demand">$200-500</td>
              <td data-label="Cut-and-Sew D2C">$800-2,500</td>
              <td data-label="Wholesale-Ready">$2,000-6,000</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td data-label="Cost Category"><strong>Legal/Admin</strong></td>
              <td data-label="Print-on-Demand">$150-400</td>
              <td data-label="Cut-and-Sew D2C">$400-1,200</td>
              <td data-label="Wholesale-Ready">$1,500-4,000</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td data-label="Cost Category"><strong>Operations/Shipping</strong></td>
              <td data-label="Print-on-Demand">$150-300</td>
              <td data-label="Cut-and-Sew D2C">$500-1,800</td>
              <td data-label="Wholesale-Ready">$2,000-6,000</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td data-label="Cost Category"><strong>Total</strong></td>
              <td data-label="Print-on-Demand"><strong>$1,800-4,700</strong></td>
              <td data-label="Cut-and-Sew D2C"><strong>$7,200-29,000</strong></td>
              <td data-label="Wholesale-Ready"><strong>$27,500-74,000</strong></td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="comparison-caption">Table: Startup cost by business model. Figures are ranges, not fixed totals — actual cost depends on garment complexity, order size, and how much you DIY versus outsource.</p>
        <caption>Table: Startup cost by business model. Figures are ranges, not fixed totals — actual cost depends on garment complexity, order size, and how much you DIY versus outsource.</caption>
