      <p class="section__text" style="margin-top: 2rem;">
        The wholesale-ready total looks alarming next to the other two, but it's usually not the right comparison for a first launch — most brands that end up wholesale-ready started in the cut-and-sew D2C tier and grew into it over 12-24 months. Our <a href="/tools/moq-calculator/" style="color:#e00;text-decoration:none;">MOQ calculator</a> helps you estimate production costs at different volumes so you can see where your specific styles land. Our <a href="/clothing-manufacturers-for-startups/" style="color:#e00;text-decoration:none;">manufacturing for startups</a> service is built around the cut-and-sew tier specifically.
      </p>
